    "profile": "Existing whole-budget RandomSplitDamage accepts explicit non_spell_unit_packets with cast_id=None and MINION_ABILITY/MINION or EFFECT/LOCATION. No forged CAST, no Spell Damage. Existing per-unit selection/RNG, ordinary Damage/death/waiting/finish pipeline retained.",
